Hello everyone,

We are running a one-day first-aid course in each office this autumn. Each office needs at least two trained first-aiders, and some certificates run out this year.

Dates:
- London: Tuesday 13 October
- Utrecht: Thursday 15 October (in Dutch)
- Cologne: Tuesday 20 October (in German)

The course runs from 09:00 to 16:30 in the office meeting room. Lunch is provided. You get a certificate that is valid for three years.

There are 8 places per office. Drivers and warehouse staff are very welcome, because they are often the first people on the scene. Please ask your manager first, then sign up by sending an email to hr@contoso-water.example by Friday 25 September.

Kind regards,
Priya
